        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Impact justification label to be used when linking a vulnerability to an element\nrepresenting a VEX product with a VexNotAffectedVulnAssessmentRelationship\nrelationship."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/VexJustificationType"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Service/serviceHostingCountry",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Specifies a country code where a software service is hosted."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/inspection",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A thorough examination or checking of documentation, records, processes, or systems to confirm compliance or adherence. An inspection needs to have a defined set of acceptance criteria (e.g. a checklist), a documentation of roles involved in the inspection (e.g. to document the inspector's independence) and a clear documentation of when and how it was performed."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "inspection"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Extension/cdxProperty",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Provides a map of a property name to a value."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Extension/CdxPropertyEntry"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/socialMedia",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A reference to a social media channel for a package."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "socialMedia"
      }
